    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Antarctica 88</strong> \u2013 a terrifying sci-fi survival horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this intense first-person adventure, you'll uncover the chilling secrets buried beneath the Antarctic ice. Monsters, mystery, and madness await. Will you survive the cold\u2026 or join the silence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are part of a four-man rescue team sent to Antarctica-1, a remote research station where your father, Dr. Vladimir Efimov, was leading a drilling operation to explore ancient ice cores. Communication with the expedition stopped six weeks ago. Now, something in the ice is awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddca Explore, fight, and survive as you face horrifying creatures hidden in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Solve environmental puzzles, uncover the truth, and make choices that shape the outcome of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b Use weapons and items you collect to fight back against mutated monsters\u2026 but choose wisely \u2014 resources are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 A branching sci-fi horror story with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Several types of mutant monsters and weapons to use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Original soundtrack designed to immerse you in the nightmare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Hardcore puzzles and item-based progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2744\ufe0f An unforgettable atmosphere of tension, mystery, and dread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions determine your fate. Antarctica 88 features multiple endings, so replay the game to uncover all paths, secrets, and story threads. Can you reveal the whole truth... or will the ice claim you too?\u00a0\ud83d\udc80</p>",
